'''Charizard''' (Japanese: '''リザードン''' ''Lizardon'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Crimson Blaze}} expansion.

